arly_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106756817", "author": {"steamid": "76561198052657304", "personaname": "Mema Boy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198052657304/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 2219, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2219, "last_played": 1640030444, "avatar": "59305ce329204cff4d0370a0ce4f1bd025758cec"}, "language": "latam", "review": "LOS ENANOS Y TU VIEJA, Y NO TE HACE FALTA MAS NADA", "timestamp_created": 1640712121, "timestamp_updated": 1640712121, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.579288065433502197", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "106617734", "author": {"steamid": "76561198968427716", "personaname": "Geramach", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/geramach/", "num_games_owned": 214, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 8640, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 355, "last_played": 1779169276, "avatar": "8442685651231b08503c282a75c5f324df2ae085"}, "language": "latam", "review": "PERO PICA EL MINERAL Y YO TE CUBRO PELOTUDO *los matan y pierde*", "timestamp_created": 1640562702, "timestamp_updated": 1640562702, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494699656963348389", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106553288", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083902152", "personaname": "サムサム", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198083902152/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 13103, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4404, "last_played": 1760824494, "avatar": "9cc48a4953d78035f053f3de141c6b0a0d30bd79"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Juegazo para coop con amigos, y si no tenés amigos como yo que soy un cavernícola asocial, ¡no te preocupes! Casi siempre se te une algún que otro cavernícola a tu partida, posiblemente algún nivel 369 que no se entiende cómo chota llegaron ahí. Comprálo, ¿qué esperás? :D", "timestamp_created": 1640499554, "timestamp_updated": 1640499554, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.471747279167175293", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106451682", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049757268", "personaname": "bernal_bb", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198049757268/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 23567, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4463, "last_played": 1757531362, "avatar": "1eb8d095cf5340aacb647cb5869f4a57cf41e8be"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Enanos que toman sin parar, patean cosas, minan y matan seres por doquier y son explotados por el capitalismo.\nBuen juego!\nPiedra y Guaro!", "timestamp_created": 1640381746, "timestamp_updated": 1640381746, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106430491", "author": {"steamid": "76561198132763500", "personaname": "AlexNKVD", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AlexNKVD/", "num_games_owned": 266, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 19661, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4215, "last_played": 1757806860, "avatar": "f7b275f200b7b5f741e099f4f5ad2abab922b658"}, "language": "latam", "review": "No hay en esta vida un juego más gratificante de jugar en coop que este. Jamás, en todo este tiempo que llevo jugando, me he cruzado a nadie con quien pelear ni cruzar palabra de mala manera. Quiero inmensamente a esta comunidad que se ha creado aquí. ROCK AND STONE, BROTHER!", "timestamp_created": 1640359541, "timestamp_updated": 1716738095, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106406696", "author": {"steamid": "76561199097662298", "personaname": "jonnysev", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199097662298/", "num_games_owned": 361, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 8554, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1419, "last_played": 1678850700, "avatar": "810b43ac1fa3339301b3f0502d216bc0719aa2ec"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Lo probé un fin de semana que estuvo gratis y me aburrió, y después lo compré, en oferta, porque unos amigos lo jugaban y ahora paso jugando. Cuesta entender al principio, pero (cosa que no hice) tiene un completo manual guía para aprender a jugarlo. Totalmente recomendado, jugarlo online.", "timestamp_created": 1640328396, "timestamp_updated": 1640328396, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105661454", "author": {"steamid": "76561198114929003", "personaname": "XCHARLIEX", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/xcharliex/", "num_games_owned": 143, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 7404, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 882, "last_played": 1767672105, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "latam", "review": "El juego es relativamente bueno pero con amigos por que jugar solo esta medio meeh", "timestamp_created": 1639253759, "timestamp_updated": 1639253759, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105591479", "author": {"steamid": "76561198096121710", "personaname": "MrJojo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198096121710/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 10381, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4659, "last_played": 1742358550, "avatar": "5fa73b554410345a07b83489826f83fe105bc7f5"}, "language": "latam", "review": "De los mejores Shooters coperativos que eh jugado, aunque tampoco esta mal jugarlo solo.\n\nEs muy intuitivo, con roles muy bien definidos, además de que no necesitas usar el voice chat para comunicarte con tu equipo (aunque si se puede si lo deseas) , ya que tiene un señalador de objetivos muy claro y con que te sepas bien los roles sabes que quieren los demás ton solo por el objetivo que están marcando.\n\nCada clase tiene habilidades y armas muy distintas entre cada una y están muy bien balanceadas y son divertidas, también si te gusta jugar solo puedes usar un robot que te ayudara en tus misiones que funciona bastante bien.\n\nLas misiones son muy variadas y duran el tiempo justo para una sesión de juego entre 15 y 30 minutos (aunque las misiones para niveles altos pueden llegar a durar 1 hora o un poco más).\n\nPor ultimo tiene muchos cosméticos desbloqueables aunque obtener los recursos y el oro para comprarlos puede ser algo tardado y tedioso y antes de que se me olvide el estilo visual es muy bueno aunque cae en lo simple.\n\nLa verdad remiendo mucho el juego y por el precio deberías darle una oportunidad.", "timestamp_created": 1639164643, "timestamp_updated": 1639164643, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105482792", "author": {"steamid": "76561199089721166", "personaname": "Pon Lacarney", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/brillantina0o0/", "num_games_owned": 301, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1507, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1198, "last_played": 1732165078, "avatar": "afdcd71753ecbb34f31becdf5b29d080b36bf65e"}, "language": "latam", "review": "una mineriaaaa", "timestamp_created": 1638994446, "timestamp_updated": 1638994446, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105442100", "author": {"steamid": "76561198140597374", "personaname": "Dupriant", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198140597374/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 5